            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Dictate Anywhere 2.4.2

- Fixed an intermittent freeze when Apple Speech started recording while macOS was changing or recovering the microphone route.
- Apple Speech now keeps the app responsive and reports a recoverable microphone error if audio capture cannot start in time.
]]></description>
